    {
      "name": "Water of Death",
      "type": "mastercrafted.mastercrafted",
      "text": {
        "content": "<p>This liquid looks, smells and tastes like water. Even the majority of alchemic and magical tests on this liquid cannot distinguish it from water. Only the spell Identify cast as a level 7 or higher or detailed alchemic test, lasting 24 hours and costing 300 gp, will reveal that this liquid is actually one of the deadliest poisons in existence.</p>",
